<title>BELARUS: Belarus rouble slipped down to 18,100 per dlr in Minsk.</title>
<headline>Belarus rouble slipped down to 18,100 per dlr in Minsk.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belarussian rouble edged down to 18,100 per dollar on the Minsk Interbank Currency Exchange from 17,600 at the previous session.</p>
<p>				    January 14	  January 13</p>
<p> Rate to dollar		    18,100		17,600</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $3.676 million	  $2.129 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
